          <p class="text-n-warm/75 text-lg leading-relaxed">Nittis serves traditional Italian dishes created with the freshest and finest ingredients. With a warm and inviting atmosphere and a fantastic craft cocktail bar, our restaurant is perfect for a romantic dinner, a business lunch, or a drink before and after a show.</p>
