        <div class="order-1 md:order-2 space-y-5">
          <h3 class="font-eurostile text-4xl md:text-5xl text-n-cream">Our Story</h3>
          <p class="text-n-warm/75 text-lg leading-relaxed">Nitti's is a Durollari Family company created with the intent of pushing a discerning message of innovation and creative passion in Italian cooking. Father Will has spent 38 years in the Italian restaurant industry, working alongside his wife Cindy and sons for their first family restaurant for over 15 years.</p>
          <p class="text-n-warm/75 text-lg leading-relaxed">Sons Arben &amp; Kuj are synonymous for their clothing brand BOND that began on 39th Street. They have dressed the likes of Anwar Hadid, Billie Eilish &amp; Lil Nas X and brought that same eye for style to the decor at Nittis.</p>
